DESCRIPTION:@DECK | ✦ AK'CHAMEL ✦ Post-Apocalyptic Psych Folk from Texas Some music entertains. Some music devastates.  Ak'chamel does something stranger. It presses unfamiliar buttons\, awakening emotions that feel ancient\, beautiful and impossible to name.  For more than a decade\, the elusive Texas collective has been building its own mythology through countless cassettes\, obscure films\, handmade instruments and ritualistic performances. Their work occupies a space where folk traditions\, hallucination\, memory and invention become impossible to separate. The result feels less like a concert than a temporary shift in perception. The sound of leaving yourself behind.  ✦ KRAMPOT ✦ Pagan Desert Doom from Vienna  --------------------------------------------------------------- presented by dazed & confused Tickets € 20\,50 | Early Bird € 23\,50 | Presale € 27\,00 | Doors  
